{"4439030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue Slime: PC Edition", "steam_appid": 4439030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROGUE SLIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A turn-based roguelite driven by a unique item-based combat system. Manage your resources, optimize your build, navigate branching paths, and restore your village between runs. Every run is different. Every build changes how you play!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique energy-based combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-lite structure with node-based maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events and difficult choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent Village building and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct and adorable 3D slime visual style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE COMBAT SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/14213e7839ddc240aaab9c51ce67c214.poster.avif?t=1776176209\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/14213e7839ddc240aaab9c51ce67c214.webm?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/14213e7839ddc240aaab9c51ce67c214.mp4?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribute your energies into item slots to charge them up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items activate automatically when their energy slots are full to deal damage, apply effects, or modify other items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEMI-PROCEDURAL MAP EXPLORATION<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/1af1c699bee647ac6aa8e79791e71990.poster.avif?t=1776176209\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/1af1c699bee647ac6aa8e79791e71990.webm?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/1af1c699bee647ac6aa8e79791e71990.mp4?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Node-based maps</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure chests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blacksmiths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANDOM EVENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/0aa56b8ece7d13d401a337e79dbdd243.poster.avif?t=1776176209\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/0aa56b8ece7d13d401a337e79dbdd243.webm?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/0aa56b8ece7d13d401a337e79dbdd243.mp4?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout each run, you will encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk and reward events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some choices strengthen your current build. Others may reshape it entirely </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VILLAGE – META PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/a2e1c66b3dbab13378f92b93c8d9ab1b.poster.avif?t=1776176209\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/a2e1c66b3dbab13378f92b93c8d9ab1b.webm?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/a2e1c66b3dbab13378f92b93c8d9ab1b.mp4?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, return to the village.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your starting slime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings, like the tavern!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your base slime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand long-term progression systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Town upgrades affect future runs, giving you more build variety and strategic options over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > BUILD VARIETY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple classes with different playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large variety of items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks chosen during level-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies between perks and item effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run encourages experimentation and adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/dbe104db5a24083c20d331e4b882c654.avif?t=1776176209\" width=1500 height=756 /></span></p>", "about_the_game